title: "ScholarProvenance: Academic Evidence, Literature Verification & Paper Generation Skill"
abstract: "A portable, evidence-first AI agent skill and workflow for turning technical repositories, benchmark datasets, experiments, architecture docs, and notes into verifiable academic research papers with strict evidence ledgers, zero citation fabrication, and multi-language support."
